referred to here? Not all Englishmen live in England, and the social )Tj 0.0221 Tw T* [(and genetic background of those that do may vary)74(. A surgeon may )]TJ 0.0241 Tw T* [(study the effects of two alternative operations for gastric ulcer)56(. But )]TJ 0.0709 Tw T* (how old are the patients? What sex are they? How severe is their )Tj 0.1647 Tw T* (disease? Where do they live? And so on. The reader needs pre-)Tj 0.2081 Tw T* (cise information on such matters to draw valid inferences from )Tj 0.1585 Tw T* (the sample that was studied to the population being considered. )Tj 0.2085 Tw T* (Statistics such as averages and standard deviations, when taken )Tj 0.0402 Tw T* (from populations, are referred to as )Tj /T1_1 1 Tf 0.0362 Tw (population parameters)Tj /T1_2 1 Tf 0.0402 Tw (. They are )Tj 0.179 Tw T* (often denoted by Greek letters; the population mean is denoted )Tj ET 
